Package: PhyloCactus
Type: Package
Title: Phylogenetic Inference, Divergence Time Estimation and 
    Molecular Identification for Cactaceae
Version: 0.5.3
Authors@R: c(
    person("Beatriz M.", "Meriño", email = "beeatrizmerino@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"), comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-9518-2331")),
    person("Tania", "Hernández-Hernández", role = "ctb"),
    person("Michiel", "Pillet", role = "ctb",comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-3215-8585")),
    person("Pablo C.", "Guerrero", email = "pabloguerrero@udec.cl", role = "aut",comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-1034-1899"))
  )
Description: Provides a reproducible workflow for reconstructing Cactaceae phylogenies from multilocus DNA sequence data and for identifying samples of cacti by DNA barcoding. Modules 1 to 13 automate GenBank sequence retrieval, multiple-sequence alignment, substitution model selection, saturation assessment, supermatrix construction, maximum-likelihood phylogenetic inference using RAxML-NG, divergence time estimation with treePL, and comparison with published phylogenies in tree space. Module 14 builds a reference library of marker sequences from the same mining, validates it with cross-validation folds and negative controls, and identifies a sample locus by locus from sequences, an assembly or sequencing reads, with a self-contained report.
URL: https://github.com/beeamerino/PhyloCactus, https://beeamerino.github.io/PhyloCactus/
BugReports: https://github.com/beeamerino/PhyloCactus/issues
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
SystemRequirements: MAFFT, RAxML-NG, ModelTest-NG, treePL and BLAST+ for the
    phylogeny (Modules 1 to 13), and TreeAnnotator 2.7.7 (BEAST 2.7) to summarise the dated
    replicates; minimap2 and samtools (assemblies), fastp and GetOrganelle
    (sequencing reads) for molecular identification (Module 14)
